  Title:
    m_Untranslated: Change the Base Map color
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>1.</b> Select the <b>Base Map</b> color picker box to open the <b>Color Picker window</b>.


      <b>2.</b> In the color wheel, use the sliders to select a new color, then take a look at the floor in your Scene view!'
